<h2>The chronology that decided the case</h2>
<div class="flow">
<div class="fstep"><strong>2019.</strong> Criminal case registered at Bhagwanbazar Police Station under Sections 406, 426 and 120B IPC (criminal breach of trust, mischief, conspiracy).</div>
<div class="fstep"><strong>December 2021 &ndash; January 2022.</strong> Anticipatory bail rejected by the Patna High Court; direction issued touching cancellation of the petitioner&rsquo;s passport.</div>
